{"id":1182,"root":"نبع","bw":"nbE","tr":"n-b-ʿ","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\">See Supplement </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَبَعَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>It</em> (water) <em>welled,</em> or <em>issued forth.</em> ― -b2- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَبَعَ عَلَيهِمْ</span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَبَأَ عليهم</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَنْبَعَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>He</em> (God) <em>made,</em> or <em>caused,</em> water <em>to issue.</em> (Msb.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَبْعٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>The tree so-called:</em> see an ex. of its n. un. in a verse cited voce <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَحَوَّفَ</span> and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَخَوَّفَ</span>. ― -b2- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَبْعٌ</span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شَوحَطٌ</span> and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شِرْيَانٌ</span> and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَتْحٌ</span>. ― -b3- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَبْعَانِ</span> The <em>two shafts</em> of a cart: so called because they were commonly made of wood of the tree called <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَبْع</span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رَادَّةٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انْبَعُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>, irregularly formed from the augmented verb <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَنْبَعَ</span>: see an ex. in a couplet cited voce <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَقَى</span>. </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":1168,"entries":5,"shownEntries":5,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"nbE"}